The '''[[2026 Vuelta a España]]''' is a three-week cycling race which is taking place in [[Monaco]], [[France]], [[Andorra]] and [[Spain]]. It is the 81st edition of the [[Vuelta a España]] and the third and final [[Grand Tour (cycling)|grand tour]] of the [[2026 in men's road cycling|2026 men's road cycling season]]. It started on 22 August in [[Monaco]], and will finish on 13 September in [[Granada]].<ref name="route">{{cite web |title=Official route of La Vuelta 2026 |url=https://www.lavuelta.es/es/recorrido-general |website=lavuelta.es |access-date=25 July 2026}}</ref>

